  m_text: 'Sensor calibration will improve finger tracking, can be sure to follow
    these steps before starting:


    1. Hold your device as shown in the image
    beside

    2. Keep your deevice still for up to 15 seconds while we calibrate
    the sensors


    <color=red>PLEASE NOTE: You will not be able to stop the procedure
    for up to 15 seconds</color>'
